[size=4]Mantella Living World - Relationships[/size]

Mantella NPCs who know where they stand with you.

[size=3]What Mantella learns[/size]
[table]
[tr][th]Mod[/th][th]Mantella learns[/th][/tr]
[tr][td]MARAS[/td][td]Married, engaged, candidate or divorced; your spouses when asked[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Romantasy[/td][td]Bond tier and points; talking earns points[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Lover's Ledger[/td][td]Your history together, her favourite acts, her other lovers[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]After a scene[/td][td]She opens a conversation and speaks first[/td][/tr]
[/table]

